{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/527991-the-changing-of-the-forum-avatars","id":527991,"title":"The Changing of the Forum Avatars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-25T12:27:00-07:00","id":527991,"title":"The Changing of the Forum Avatars","content":"I have become aware in the past few years that some of our fellow forumites finding it confusing/disturbing when a poster changes their avatar without warning or explanation. For their sake, I have created this thread for the considerate among us to state their change of forum clothes.<br /> <br /> Hi, I'm Prometheus878, the poster who makes kinda-sorta-not-really funny comments and generally tries too hard to be engaging. I mostly hang out on the Exalted and Off Topic forums. I used to have Gundam or giant robot themed avatars, before <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/525927-kickstarter-update-77-layout-infor-cute-art\">Mel Uran blessed the world with the cutest signature characters portraits in Exalted history</a>.<br /> <br /> <i>Now, I am Volfer, warrior of the Dawn Caste!</i> <b>Fear my adorable might!</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T12:40:09-07:00","id":528008,"title":"","content":"Thanks Promy. I appreciate the notification.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kil